          "page": 2,
          "section": "2. Experimental Method and Characterizations",
          "quote": "The in-situ composites of pre-set composition (Nb 80Si15-xCr5Alx (x=0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, 3) and Nb 80-xSi12Cr5Al3Mox (x=5, 10)) were synthesized by suction casting vacuum-arc-melting-cum casting technique under high purity argon atmosphere. The as-cast alloys were prepared using the high purity (99.9%) elements. To ensure compositional and chemical homogeneity, the as-cast buttons were re-melted 4-5 times.",
